ical detail, high frequency ductility, and mid frequency clarityMarked promotion.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"aeProduct.getSubject()\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1MACnmMoQMeJjy0Foq6AShVXa3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n\n<p>Quality Is More Powerful Than Price</p>\n\n<p>High purity oxygen free copper plating silver KZ through strict quality test, salt spray test, bending test,Plug</p>\n\n<p>and play test, pull test, burn test, crash test...The formal power workshop, production process, all kinds of</p>\n\n<p>tricks to defeat the civil hair burning wire workshop.</p>\n\n<p style=\"     line-height: inherit;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img alt=\"aeProduct.getSubject()\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1Hijer50TMKJjSZFNq6y_1FXa0.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"aeProduct.getSubject()\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1LZD5syAKL1JjSZFoq6ygCFXa5.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"aeProduct.getSubject()\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1A.zQizihSKJjy0Feq6zJtpXaN.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"aeProduct.getSubject()\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1yPglizqhSKJjSspnq6A79XXaj.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"aeProduct.getSubject()\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1xg15hUMgYeJjSZFGq6xsMXXap.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"aeProduct.getSubject()\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1ej0FXq4441JjSZFsq6AB8pXai.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"aeProduct.getSubject()\" src=\"http://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1uFlGh2NNTKJjSspeq6ySwpXaP.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px;\">\u00a0</p>\n\n<p style=\"     line-height: inherit;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\u00a0</p>",
